# The jack-o'-lantern football: a pumpkin stretched into a football, with white
# laces on top and a carved grin on the front. The team's ball and the game's icon.
size 9 5 5
voxel 0.045
colors
  p pumpkin
  P pumpkinDark
  n white
  g glow
# A round middle that tapers to a point at each end.
box 2 0 1 6 4 3 p
box 2 1 0 6 3 4 p
box 1 1 1 1 3 3 p
box 7 1 1 7 3 3 p
box 0 2 2 0 2 2 P
box 8 2 2 8 2 2 P
# Seams toward the ends.
box 2 1 0 2 3 0 P
box 6 1 0 6 3 0 P
box 2 1 4 2 3 4 P
box 6 1 4 6 3 4 P
# Laces.
box 3 4 2 5 4 2 n
box 4 4 1 4 4 3 n
# Carved face.
box 3 3 0 3 3 0 g
box 5 3 0 5 3 0 g
box 3 1 0 5 1 0 g
